[REQUIREMENT]
MID: e7159b2a313d497a9a223486290cd3fe
UID: SWR-APP-001
TITLE: Task periods
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall run the control task every 1 ms and the user interface
task every 10 ms.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-007

[REQUIREMENT]
MID: 7399af6b5ea14a4bbf3de0dac4b2bf0d
UID: SWR-APP-002
TITLE: Button events
STATEMENT: >>>
A rising edge of the start button shall send ``START``. A rising edge of the
stop button shall send ``CLEAR_FAULT`` in ``FAULT`` and ``STOP`` in every other
state.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-005
